# Zennly

> Zennly is a booking and management platform for appointment-based service businesses in Nepal and worldwide — spas, wellness centers, salons, nail studios, tattoo and piercing studios, yoga studios, gyms, barbershops, clinics, physiotherapy and cleaning services — from a single location to many branches. It replaces phone-and-spreadsheet scheduling with online booking, staff/room scheduling, discount approval workflows, and daily payment reconciliation, unified across every branch.

Zennly is not a calendar widget or generic booking tool — it works for a single location and scales to multi-branch teams, with: staff transfers between branches, discount-request approval chains, role-based access for owners/managers/front-desk, and a locked daily financial close.

## Entity facts

- Name: Zennly (zennly.io). Also referred to as "Zennly booking software". Not related to zennly.org.
- Type: Web-based booking and business management software for service businesses in Nepal.
- Markets: built in Nepal. Available to service businesses in any country on request, including the USA, UK, Canada, Australia and the UAE.
- Based in: Lalitpur (Patan), Bagmati Province, Nepal. Launched 2026. Built by Zunkireelabs (https://zunkireelabs.com, founded 2018).
- Contact: info@zennly.io, {{ site.telephone }}.
- First live client: Nuad Thai Spa Kathmandu, four branches, 39 therapists, 12 rooms, 194 services.
- Pricing: custom quote, no fixed tiers. Payments are recorded by method (cash, card, online).

